   ❯❯❱ axios - CVE-2026-42033
          Severity: HIGH                                                                                     
          Affected versions of axios are vulnerable to Improperly Controlled Modification of Object Prototype
          Attributes ('Prototype Pollution'). Axios do not guard reads of config properties (e.g.            
