          Severity: HIGH                                                                                     
          Affected versions of axios are vulnerable to Insertion of Sensitive Information Into Sent Data. The
          Node.js HTTP adapter in axios fails to clear the Proxy-Authorization header when a request that    
          initially used an authenticated HTTP proxy is redirected to a target requiring no proxy (e.g. an   
          HTTP-to-HTTPS redirect with no HTTPS proxy configured), leaking the proxy credentials to the final 
          origin server.                                                                                     
                                                                                                             
